        ecrm:P3_has_note    "(Lower right corner cut) Engraved design printed in mauve on plain cotton shows four scenes with people and animals engaged in various activities, labeled Route de St. Cloud, Route de Poissy, Les Joueurs de Boules and Le Joueur de Cornemuse. On side of stone in center of composition: Delmès Sculpsit. Several breaks and tears have ben darned. Long yellow-brown stains."@en ;
